            <div xml:id="m-ab43986b-9b39-4893-b852-a29044775282">
              <lg xml:id="m-abb9e7eb-10d3-4a15-ad84-c46b315d0434">
                <l xml:id="m-9e06bb5e-7dec-46e4-88a9-1d2e34ab453f" facs="#m-1639d97e-28e8-4170-8be3-ab36fefada8c" label="text-like">1008 Commemorations of the Sunday or of the Feria.</l><l xml:id="m-803740d4-1629-4f7d-baf9-029cdb1f2edc" facs="#m-3c6b9fd6-4d47-435b-8c6c-8c0f307ebb9b" label="ambiguous">Monday.</l><l xml:id="m-6980d986-ff98-42c7-af55-e17591ae1129" facs="#m-f7cddf86-4e78-4b43-b864-42791248c973" label="text-like">At Lauds.</l><l xml:id="m-d6eeabba-cc16-4509-9da0-c2405f2d48e1" facs="#m-d36583b5-5b99-4830-bea0-9e6b9d011509" label="ambiguous">Ant. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-5f3ec247-c162-49d7-85da-b06ff7a7c9c4" facs="#m-cb6c8213-bf29-4c58-abcb-27a9e5990124" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-4ada6943-7ecd-491e-8e35-f2da0fe0201c" facs="#m-39350438-9aca-4e3e-b406-3386547a6ce8" label="lyrics-like">N dí-e mágno“ festi-vi-tá-tis stá-bat Jésus et</l><l xml:id="m-4d71075f-8a35-46f0-b831-0f8d53fe9b81" facs="#m-b0c3e1e9-291d-479b-9c87-a4c6ebba92fe" label="lyrics-like">clamábat dí-cens: Si quis sí-tit, véni-at ad me, et bí-bat.</l><l xml:id="m-b954251d-b826-4cda-83fe-f64b566de6ea" facs="#m-72a30f7b-bdd6-4d97-974d-544b6f7df3f1" label="lyrics-like">V. Eripe me de inimícis méis.</l><l xml:id="m-a7f7ef15-357b-41f7-8f54-7ce5120b5847" facs="#m-926b1d12-10db-4fe2-950b-6a5dda4c2de7" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-7c3169a8-6577-4e77-857f-1f8c86c5dfd4" facs="#m-8bf67329-e5fd-46d3-a02b-77b105074d40" label="lyrics-like">(Anctífica, quaésumus Dómine, l nobis indulgéntiam propitius largire</l><l xml:id="m-fdefa767-5032-4862-9d44-2ec4752964d6" facs="#m-91134e0d-6fa1-44ca-9a1f-635fe452bb3d" label="lyrics-like">O nostra jejúnia:=t cunctárum l culpárum. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-78c3b957-bb91-4202-ad83-1ac4b77eedd3" facs="#m-4c92d107-01c1-4b0e-9f2c-7123b371bef9" label="text-like">At Vesp.</l><l xml:id="m-9290a454-31e5-4583-97a6-fddbd7ae2ada" facs="#m-a7456add-60c8-42ed-988a-3366496c4002" label="ambiguous">Ant. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-51e0e39a-d72a-48ea-a895-99119155a5a9" facs="#m-62af85a4-00b2-4732-b044-d7ccbd13b4e0" label="lyrics-like">OI quis sí-tit, “ véni-at et bíbat: et de véntre</l><l xml:id="m-64849af6-dfaa-4f1f-9220-b38cde13c393" facs="#m-30b6c14b-a07f-4a28-a9a2-e2451a817469" label="lyrics-like">é-jus flu-ent áquae vívae.</l><l xml:id="m-533a1831-fa8f-499d-855a-0931bcf01b2f" facs="#m-5c453747-d9dd-4337-a78c-0bbb3548af14" label="lyrics-like">V. Eripe me Dómine ab hómine málo.</l><l xml:id="m-fbcfd4ec-2b0e-4284-b64a-fc4389650456" facs="#m-152fb2ee-caa8-4fd1-8b93-1f51baf798f8" label="lyrics-like">R. A viro iníquo éripe me.</l><l xml:id="m-aba5ace8-0e48-4136-96a2-829b28563bf1" facs="#m-bbcc0218-26f2-4f36-b3d7-9c7404ecb4a5" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-7f694e04-634c-4193-b5b9-2c3f37080733" facs="#m-e2e77bd8-5a0b-43a0-b51a-8229f9c8c07e" label="lyrics-like">A, quaésumus Dómine, pópulo) tua semper mereátur protectióne</l><l xml:id="m-22ad55c3-f62a-49f1-bd08-fff945bc45b1" facs="#m-271c08c7-02f0-4610-9a13-b3700bf233a3" label="lyrics-like">A tuo salútem mentis et córpo¬ deféndi. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-4139e4f5-b000-418d-bb92-b0ec0a8f9624" facs="#m-176da7f0-9623-411c-8ff7-903fa08a9332" label="lyrics-like">ris:* ut bonis opéribus inhaeréndo,</l><l xml:id="m-fe98b59d-f10c-4c46-b31f-73323f61f0d9" facs="#m-0211b571-e5f0-42c5-8e7c-0254dfeaf0a5" label="ambiguous">Tuesday.</l><l xml:id="m-2e2813f5-81c1-4444-9738-1300adeb2f4b" facs="#m-e8613ca5-f48d-4a2d-9ab9-1567277da705" label="text-like">At Lauds.</l><l xml:id="m-a73eeaa7-7e3f-46f6-b446-90ce4dd98fc8" facs="#m-3417756d-fed3-48b8-b3c5-2260cb5d42b5" label="ambiguous">Ant. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-d11a4925-a59d-42cc-b46a-ac0aa099123d" facs="#m-c0c1ebe8-4050-407b-ac2d-27c769081023" label="ambiguous">T</l><l xml:id="m-957ec62c-0a26-4cca-b0bf-f60da550c5ec" facs="#m-e9d484f4-de1a-4584-b7f5-e8eb842cb820" label="lyrics-like">Empus mé-um “ nondum advénit, témpus au</l><l xml:id="m-8185401f-64c7-4f01-bf8c-bcd71d17fe8e" facs="#m-2614dd95-1ffb-4534-b8fa-f0e1daf2cfac" label="lyrics-like">tem véstrum semper est pa-rá-tum.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>